{"data":[{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"1884988099673113022","created_at":"2025-01-30T15:32:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1884988099673113022"],"id":"1884988099673113022","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":29,"impression_count":316698,"like_count":371,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":427,"retweet_count":3},"text":"突然找到了前夫去年大年初二操孕妇的视频。我拍的。但是就几秒钟。当时先是倒腾半天勃起不了，勉强塞进去之后几秒钟就射了。谁想看？？？","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1884988099673113022"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"1884912723718476166","created_at":"2025-01-30T10:33:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1884912723718476166"],"id":"1884912723718476166","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":69,"impression_count":427639,"like_count":629,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":57,"retweet_count":13},"text":"前夫是个特别迷信的人。大年初二，他曾经让我看着他操一个孕妇，说开年操孕妇会转运。然后他也会在推特给我找年轻的处男，让我嗦他的鸡巴，然后把射进嘴里的全部吞下，说这样一整年都会顺风顺水。我就是这样被他带进了开放式关系的无尽深渊。","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1884912723718476166"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"1884561249687790013","created_at":"2025-01-29T11:16:30.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1884561249687790013"],"id":"1884561249687790013","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":41,"impression_count":281019,"like_count":382,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":33,"retweet_count":5},"text":"四年前的大年初一，跟前夫在澳门一对夫妻玩交换正式入圈。两条大鸡巴同时塞进我嘴里捅得我干呕的感觉还记忆犹新。只是四年后的今天我们都离婚了。","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1884561249687790013"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"1884288282496049307","created_at":"2025-01-28T17:11:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1884288282496049307"],"id":"1884288282496049307","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":18,"impression_count":213808,"like_count":242,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":31,"retweet_count":1},"text":"12点一过，就被前夫🐍进去了。。。不想动了，明天年初一再清理清理。。。","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1884288282496049307"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"1884166075987927215","created_at":"2025-01-28T09:06:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1884166075987927215"],"id":"1884166075987927215","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":114305,"like_count":85,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":70,"retweet_count":0},"text":"大年初一，开年活动选项：\n1️⃣ 爬山\n2️⃣ 打球\n3️⃣ 打炮\n4️⃣ 找前夫看电影\n\n选哪个？","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1884166075987927215"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"1883143626945151144","created_at":"2025-01-25T13:23:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1883143626945151144"],"id":"1883143626945151144","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":15,"impression_count":391782,"like_count":123,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":26,"retweet_count":0},"text":"收到了粉丝送我的5J车厘子🍒，果子很大，很暖心，但让我不禁想起前夫之前的变态行为。他将我弄湿后，把车厘子塞到我逼里，捏着果子上的小柄胡乱捅一番后，拿出来细细品尝起来这包浆的车厘子。把果肉吃掉后，将果核又塞回我逼了，然后开始正式做爱。还问我这样的效果是不是跟之前鸡巴入珠的炮友差不多。","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1883143626945151144"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"1883065851072692327","created_at":"2025-01-25T08:14:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1883065851072692327"],"id":"1883065851072692327","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":7,"impression_count":166247,"like_count":177,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":37,"retweet_count":0},"text":"前夫两个推特号，一个6万粉被外围女拿去接单，被封了。另外一个2万粉忘记密码登不了。现在好了，回归家庭只管操我……真心希望有关部门部门能够管管他。","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1883065851072692327"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"1882997847798517855","created_at":"2025-01-25T03:44:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1882997847798517855"],"id":"1882997847798517855","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":7,"impression_count":111621,"like_count":84,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":13,"retweet_count":0},"text":"醒来第一眼看到的，是躺在我臂弯里睡觉也会嘴角上扬的可爱儿子。第二眼看到的，是永远不穿内裤，鸡巴头永远低垂左右摇摆的前夫。他在勤劳地搞着卫生。","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1882997847798517855"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"1882815535056072720","created_at":"2025-01-24T15:39:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1882815535056072720"],"id":"1882815535056072720","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":12,"impression_count":161630,"like_count":124,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":40,"retweet_count":1},"text":"刚才给他口交，看见他鸡巴有颗大痘痘，我稍微一用力就把它挤爆了，里面的脓汁噗呲一下射到我的眼睛里了，比他的射精猛得多得多。","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1882815535056072720"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"1882765987667419335","created_at":"2025-01-24T12:22:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1882765987667419335"],"id":"1882765987667419335","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":120792,"like_count":71,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":25,"retweet_count":0},"text":"请问一下大家，打开家门的那一刻，见到整天只穿一条中间有鸟洞的秋裤，鸡巴耷拉露出来的老公，你会作何感想？","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1882765987667419335"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"1882462300050948546","created_at":"2025-01-23T16:16:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1882462300050948546"],"id":"1882462300050948546","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":107909,"like_count":73,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":0},"text":"前夫一回广州就开始作妖，真想学热播剧漂白那样买台绞肉机把他碎了🤯🤯🤯🤯🤯","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1882462300050948546"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"1882082448693228029","created_at":"2025-01-22T15:06:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1882082448693228029"],"id":"1882082448693228029","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":87,"impression_count":254914,"like_count":139,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":23,"retweet_count":5},"text":"谁有宝藏黄推，快快 @ 出来，分享你们的宝藏资源！！！我前夫有用😹😹😹","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1882082448693228029"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"1881722169815912807","created_at":"2025-01-21T15:15:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1881722169815912807"],"id":"1881722169815912807","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":9,"impression_count":135950,"like_count":144,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":36,"retweet_count":0},"tex